      ms: 9280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:78alnn'
    'male|a||This dashed line is zero: coverage leaving that share exactly where it was.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1bquibn'
    'male|a||The estimate, for the people whom winning moved onto Medicaid: 0.93 percentage points fewer above the line.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:2ayghs'
    male|a||And its ninety-five percent confidence interval runs from 4.44 points fewer to 2.59 points more.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:ag8sdm'
    male|a||The interval crosses zero, so the result is not significant, and blood pressure and cholesterol came out the same way.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:qst0h2'
    'male|a||Some read that as a verdict: Medicaid buys people care, but not better physical health.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:692lif'
    male|a||To judge that verdict, we will read the interval, then ask how big an effect this study could ever have seen, and then weigh the two readings.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:z99h6n'
    male|a||Start with the interval, because two very different results can both fail to be significant.:
