      ms: 5680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1wlpds3'
    male|a||Picture a second study, made up for the comparison, whose interval runs from half a point fewer to 0.3 more.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:l80uhx'
    male|a||A quick check. Both intervals cross zero. Which result tells you more about whether coverage lowers blood sugar?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:oj1xs0'
    'male|a||The narrow one: it rules out every effect bigger than half a point, while Oregon''s rules out almost nothing anyone expected.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8760
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'male|a||The narrow study has learned something: its data rule out any effect larger than about half a point, either way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7680
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'male|a||Now hold Oregon''s interval against a hard limit: only 5.1 percent were above the line, so no effect can remove more than 5.1 points.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1l9g70c'
    'male|a||Its left end, at minus 4.44, reaches almost all the way there: coverage clearing nearly nine cases in ten fits these data.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:124oeor'
    male|a||And its right end fits a small rise. One interval, compatible with a large gain, with nothing, and with a little harm.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:rp4ck1'
    male|a||So not significant tells you only that zero is inside the interval. Its width tells you how much else is inside with it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:kk5zps'
    'male|a||The share above the diabetes line throws away detail, so the study also reported a finer measure: the average glycated haemoglobin itself.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9480
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    male|a||For one person with diabetes, starting medicine lowers it by about one point within six months. That is a large, worthwhile change.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1noyykb'
    'male|a||Oregon''s estimate for the average: plus 0.01 points, with an interval from minus 0.09 to plus 0.11.':
