      ms: 8640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1292g1n'
    'male|a||That is what low power means: a study that will usually say not significant even when something real is going on.':
